                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 9.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Solomoni amiia khu bwami bwoosi khukhwama khu luuchi lwa Efurati khukhwola khu sibala sie Bafilisiti ne lulwaakha lwa Misiri. Bibala bino biareraanga kumuruungo nikwo Solomoni enyanga mala biakholela Solomoni mu limenya liewe lioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.21"
            ]
