              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chikhaafu chinefu ekhumi chichalisibwa biakhulia mungo ne chikhaafu kamakhumi kabili che mumayilwe enje, kamakheese emia, ne khutasakho chikhulo, bikicheu, chimboongo ne chingokho.",
          "type": "text",
