          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni amiia khu bibala bioosi mumbo mwe luluuchi lwa Efurati khukhwama Tifusa khukhwola Kasa. Aba ne kumuleembe chimbeka choosi chichabotookhelela sibala siewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bulamu bwa Solomoni bwoosi, babaandu be Buyuda bamenya mu muleembe khukhwama Dani khukhwola Beerisheba. Buli mundu aaba ne kimisabibu ne kimituli kiewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
