              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Solomoni aba ne kamataala chielefu kamakhumi kane ke chifarasi ne banamae be khu farasi chielefu ekhumi na chibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi be khureera biakhulia bie lichipi lio mwami Solomoni, buli mulala khu mwesi kwewe, bareera buli sisienyekhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bareeranga akhaba eshayiri ne bunyaasi bwe chifarasi ne bibiaayo bie kimilimo, niio bienyekhana. Buli mundu areeranga khuloondekhana nga enyekhana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
