              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumw. 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwami Solomoni aboola chisimo chielefu chitaru. Chinyimbo chewe chaba eelefu ndala ne chiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekesia khu bimelwa bioosi khukhwama khu mirongooro kimitarakwa kimiboofu kia Lebanoni khukhwola khu nyoonyi ekhulaanga mu masiisi. Ekesia lundi khu saang'i, chinyuni, bimoola ne ching'eeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bamaanga mu bibala bioosi khurekeeresia ke bukesi bwa Solomoni. Babaami boosi be khu liloba ba baaba ne baulila bukesi bwa Solomoni barumaanga babaandu khu niye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
